            <li>Departs from <strong>Fumba Peninsula</strong> (not Stone Town or other beaches)</li>
            <li>Operated by <strong>licensed original Safari Blue company</strong> (ask for operator name)</li>
            <li>Traditional <strong>lateen-sail wooden dhow</strong> (not a motorized tourist boat)</li>
